OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy with scattered
OL,6,Fshowers moving through from the
OL,7,Fnorthwest. Showers likely to turn
OL,8,Fheavy at times with a risk of hail and
OL,9,Fthunder, though turning drier and
OL,10,Fbrighter later in the afternoon. Light
OL,11,Fwesterly winds freshening in showers.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry start to the evening
OL,14,Fbut showers move into the north of the
OL,15,Fregion, bringing heavy downpours and
OL,16,Fthunder at times. These moves
OL,17,Fsouthwards during the early hours.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
