OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FHeavy and thundery showers
OL,6,Fcontinue to move southwards across the
OL,7,Fregion through the morning. Turning
OL,8,Fdrier and brighter into the afternoon.
OL,9,FSlightly fresher than Wednesday.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,12,FTemperatures staying below average
OL,13,Finto the weekend. Isolated showers
OL,14,Fcontinuing but becoming more settled
OL,15,Fagain by Sunday with sunny spells
OL,16,Fthroughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
